\ufb01 ts and Other Allowances as morefully described in \ufb01 rst and second Schedules setout in the Annex IV hereto. 7. TAXES ON EMOLUMENTS\n\nAdvance Personal Income Tax on emoluments of sta\ufb00 shall be borne by the respective employees.\n\n8. CONVERSION OF THE BASIC SALARY"
